  "description": "A slave girl blessed with a curse. \"Don't forget. You owe me a life, and you promised to be mine.\" Reniae was blessed with the ability to charm men by the goddess Inanna. But for her, it feels more like a curse. After being taken as a slave to the Golden Forest, she flees to the Northland where she finds Kun... and saves his life. \n\n(Source: Manta)",
